[Niall Donovan]: Here is the implementation for the Cache Service middleware. As discussed in our private channel, I have focused on modularity, a robust key generation strategy using SHA-256, and strict adherence to the edge cases we agreed upon (bypassing non-GET requests and not caching errors).

